# URL Shortner Service

This is a simple REST-based URL shortner application built using Spring Boot.

## Features
- Shortnes a long URL and returns a unique short URL
- Returns the same short URL if the same input URL is provided again
- Redirects short URL to original URL
- Stores data in memory
- Provides metrics API for top 3 most shortened domains.

## APIs

### Shorten URL

POST /api/shorten

Request :

{
"url" : "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=abc"
}

Response :
{
"shortUrl" : "https://localhost:8082/u/aB3xP9
}

### Redirect
GET /u/{code}

### Metrics
GET /api/metrics/top-domains

## How to Run
mvn spring-boot:run

